<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Reset Password - ARVYNO</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
      background-color: #f4f4f6;
      color: #18181b;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 35px 15px;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 540px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background-color: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid #e4e4e7;
      border-radius: 12px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
    }
    .header {
      background-color: #ffffff;
      padding: 36px 24px 20px 24px;
      text-align: center;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f1f4;
    }
    .logo-img {
      max-height: 65px;
      width: auto;
      display: inline-block;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .content {
      padding: 32px 28px;
    }
    .content h2 {
      margin-top: 0;
      font-size: 19px;
      color: #18181b;
    }
    .content p {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #52525b;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 13px 28px;
      background: #18181b;
      color: #ffffff !important;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin: 18px 0 10px 0;
    }
    .footer {
      background-color: #fafafa;
      padding: 24px;
      text-align: center;
      border-top: 1px solid #f1f1f4;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #71717a;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }
    .footer a {
      color: #92722a;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <img src="https://www.arvynobd.com/images/logo/arvyno-logo.png" alt="ARVYNO" class="logo-img" />
    </div>
    <div class="content">
      <h2>Password Reset Request</h2>
      <p>Hello <%= name %>,</p>
      <p>
        We received a request to reset the password for your ARVYNO account. Click the button below to set a new password:
      </p>
      <div style="text-align: center;">
        <a class="btn" href="<%= resetUILink %>">Reset Password</a>
      </div>
      <p style="font-size: 12px; color: #a1a1aa; margin-top: 20px;">
        If you did not request a password reset, please ignore this email. This link will safely expire in 10 minutes.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      <strong>ARVYNO</strong> &bull; Luxury Apparel &amp; Sartorial Essentials<br />
      House-50, Block-F, Road-2, Eastern Housing, Pallabi, Dhaka, Bangladesh, 1216<br />
      Hotline: <a href="tel:+8801886957897">+880 1886-957897</a> &bull; Web: <a href="https://www.arvynobd.com" target="_blank">www.arvynobd.com</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
